  "description": "First launched in 1988, this title introduced the world to Detective Ryunosuke Todo. Now, it’s your turn to enter the \"Kohaku-kan\"—a place where secrets are buried deep. Navigate a complex web of human relationships and piece together the clues in this definitive deduction adventure.\n\nImmerse yourself in a nostalgic, sepia-colored world inspired by the Taisho Roman era. As bodies begin to pile up, can you unmask the killer and uncover the dark motives hidden in the shadows?\n \n\n *This application does not have a scene select mode.\n *The main game and gallery screen (*Gallery) are in Japanese version.\n *Other menu screens and \"How to play\" screens are in English.",
